<title>UK: Commerzbank sets warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG has ssued American-style call and put warrants on shares of five German stocks.</p>
<p>The five stocks are Allianz AG Holding, BASF AG, Bayer AG, Deutsche Bank AG and Hoechst AG.</p>
<p>The warrants mature on September 16, 1998 and the payment date is July 23, 1997. They are listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
